CASE 2 (admin authorized, tool executes): {'order_id': 'ORD-5521', 'refunded': 42.5}"}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"In the executed example, were the arguments to issue_refund valid in Case 1?","qKn":"ಚಲಾಯಿಸಿದ ಉದಾಹರಣೆಯಲ್ಲಿ Case 1 ನಲ್ಲಿ issue_refund ya arguments ಸರಿಯಾಗಿದ್ದವೇ?","opts":["No, they were malformed","Yes, they were perfectly valid; the rejection was purely about authorization","The arguments were never checked","They were missing a required field"],"optsKn":["ಇಲ್ಲ, ಅವೂ ಸರಿಯಾಗಿ ರಚಿಸಲಾಗಿಲ್ಲ","ಹೌದು, ಅವೂ ಸಂಪೂರ್ಣ ಸರಿಯಾಗಿದ್ದವು; ತಿರಸ್ಕರಣೆ ಕೇವಲ authorization ಬಗ್ಗೆ","Arguments ಎಂದಿಗೂ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಲ್ಪಡಲಿಲ್ಲ","ಅಗತ್ಯ field ಕಳೆದುಹೋಗಿತ್ತು"],"correct":1},{"q":"What genuinely differed between Case 1 and Case 2 in the executed code?","qKn":"ಚಲಾಯಿಸಿದ code ನಲ್ಲಿ Case 1 ಮತ್ತು Case 2 ನಡುವೆ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಏನೂ ಭಿನ್ನವಾಗಿತ್ತು?","opts":["The tool arguments","The role (support_agent vs admin)","The tool being called","Nothing, both cases were identical"],"optsKn":["Tool arguments","Role (support_agent vs admin)","ಕರೆಯಲ್ಪಡುತ್ತಿರುವ tool","ಏನೂ ಇಲ್ಲ, ಎರಡೂ ಪ್ರಕರಣಗಳು ಒಂದೇ"],"correct":1},{"q":"Why is prompt injection fundamentally an authorization problem rather than purely a text-filtering one?","qKn":"Prompt injection ಮೂಲಭೂತವಾಗಿ ಏಕೆ ಕೇವಲ text-filtering ಬದಲು authorization ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ?","opts":["Text filtering always works perfectly","The real defense is the tool-call layer still enforcing authorization regardless of what the model was tricked into attempting","Prompt injection cannot be defended against","Authorization has nothing to do with it"],"optsKn":["Text filtering ಯಾವಾಗಲೂ ಪರಿಪೂರ್ಣವಾಗಿ ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ","ನಿಜ ರಕ್ಷಣೆ tool-call ಪದರ ಇನ್ನೂ authorization ಜಾರಿಗೊಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ","Prompt injection ವಿರುದ್ಧ ರಕ್ಷಿಸಲಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ","Authorization ಗೆ ಇದರ ಜೊತೆ ಯಾವುದೂ ಸಂಬಂಧ ಇಲ್ಲ"],"correct":1},{"q":"Why should an agent acting on a user's behalf not automatically inherit the user's full permission set?","qKn":"User ya ಪರವಾಗಿ ಕಾರ್ಯನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುವ agent ಏಕೆ ಸ್ವಯಂಚಾಲಿತವಾಗಿ user ya ಪೂರ್ಣ permission set ಪಡೆಯಬಾರದು?","opts":["Agents cannot have permissions","Least privilege: the agent should only get what its specific task genuinely needs","It would make the agent faster","Users have no permissions to inherit"],"optsKn":["Agents permissions ಹೊಂದಲಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ","Least privilege: agent ಗೆ ಅದರ ನಿರ್ದಿಷ್ಟ ಕೆಲಸಕ್ಕೆ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಬೇಕಾದದ್ದೂ ಮಾತ್ರ ಸಿಗಬೇಕು","ಇದೂ agent ಅನ್ನೂ ವೇಗಗೊಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ","Users ಗೆ ಪಡೆಯಲು ಯಾವುದೂ permissions ಇಲ್ಲ"],"correct":1}]}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Putting It All Together","headingKn":"ಎಲ್ಲವನ್ನೂ ಒಟ್ಟುಗೂಡಿಸುವುದು","bodyEn":"A safe tool-call pipeline checks existence, validation, authorization, and sandboxing as four genuinely independent layers — the executed example proves this concretely by showing the exact same valid arguments accepted for one role and rejected for another, a distinction validation alone could never produce.","bodyKn":"ಸುರಕ್ಷಿತ tool-call pipeline ಅಸ್ತಿತ್ವ, validation, authorization, ಮತ್ತು sandboxing ಅನ್ನೂ ನಾಲ್ಕೂ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಸ್ವತಂತ್ರ ಪದರಗಳಾಗಿ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}}]
